<!--
  FalconPulsar Menu Bar.app — Hardened Runtime entitlements.

  Same philosophy as the installer: empty dict = Hardened Runtime with no
  exceptions.

  The menu-bar app does three things:
    1. Draws a status-bar icon and menu (AppKit, no entitlement needed)
    2. Polls http://127.0.0.1:7433 to check REST API health
       (Hardened Runtime does not restrict outbound network — only sandbox
        does, and we are not sandboxing)
    3. Spawns `docker compose ...` via Process() to start/stop the stack
       (allowed for signed system binaries under Hardened Runtime)

  No JIT, no dynamic library loading from untrusted paths, no camera/mic,
  no Apple Events targeting other apps. Empty entitlements dict is correct.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
</dict>
</plist>
